There is a relationship betw een these two incidents. One 
incident, the opening sex/ murder, is called the inciting 
incident, because it sets ¥ in motion; it is ¹ visual 
representation ¡ key incident, what ¥ is about, 
and draws the đ into ½. Remember 
the definition of incident: "a specific event or occurrence that 
occurs in relation to something else."  
When I understood this connection, ư almost a 
revelation. Using an opening sequence to draw ë 
character ¶  
130 —­—  
Î is pure cinema. From here on ê rest of 
É, ¥ is ń, İ and 
premise are established, ©re is a Î, a direction 
to follow—and all because ¡ connection between these 
